            "content": [
             {
              "text": "Added integration test for this (multiple concurrent threads modifying and reading), verified issue exists (leaves Fedora unusable/locked)",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         },
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "Implemented Nigel's patch - this leaves DBXML in a useable state, but can result in the policy index being out of step with the policies, as operations fail if there is a deadlock",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
