      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<ul>\n\t<li>Added integration test for this (multiple concurrent threads modifying and reading), verified issue exists (leaves Fedora unusable/locked)</li>\n\t<li>Implemented Nigel's patch - this leaves DBXML in a useable state, but can result in the policy index being out of step with the policies, as operations fail if there is a deadlock</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "09/Jan/11 7:59 PM",
     "id": "11757",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10815/comment/11757",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "09/Jan/11 7:59 PM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<ul>\n\t<li>Implemented configurable retry for operations where deadlock failure occurs.<br/>\n(all code in local repo, not pushed to github)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Refs:<br/>\n<a href=\"http://etutorials.org/XML/xml+data+management/Part+II+Native+XML+Databases/Chapter+4.+Embedded+XML+Databases/4.4+Building+Applications+for+Embedded+XML+Databases/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://etutorials.org/XML/xml+data+management/Part+II+Native+XML+Databases/Chapter+4.+Embedded+XML+Databases/4.4+Building+Applications+for+Embedded+XML+Databases/</a> for info on handling deadlocks.<br/>\n<a href=\"http://download.oracle.com/docs/cd/E17276_01/html/gsg_xml_txn/java/blocking_deadlocks.html#deadlocks\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://download.oracle.com/docs/cd/E17276_01/html/gsg_xml_txn/java/blocking_deadlocks.html#deadlocks</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://download.oracle.com/docs/cd/E17276_01/html/gsg_xml_txn/java/lockingsubsystem.html#configdeadlkdetect\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://download.oracle.com/docs/cd/E17276_01/html/gsg_xml_txn/java/lockingsubsystem.html#configdeadlkdetect</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://download.oracle.com/docs/cd/E17276_01/html/gsg_xml_txn/java/lockingsubsystem.html#deadlockresolve\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://download.oracle.com/docs/cd/E17276_01/html/gsg_xml_txn/java/lockingsubsystem.html#deadlockresolve</a></p>",
     "created": "09/Jan/11 11:35 PM",
     "id": "11758",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10815/comment/11758",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
